  "body": "Can't make the scheduled viewings? No problem! We're happy to accommodate private viewings at a time that suits you. Please contact Claire Cassin at Ray White Mairangi Bay to arrange - we look forward to showing you through!\r\n\r\nBright! Fresh! And full of warmth! Get excited - this brand-new beauty is ready for its first owners!\r\n\r\nYou'll appreciate the quality the moment you step inside, with thoughtful extra features and stunning detailing throughout that sets this home apart from others. \r\nBeautifully considered and thoughtfully designed for modern family living, this home presents an exceptional opportunity to secure a sophisticated freehold home in one of Mairangi Bay's most sought-after locations. \r\n\r\nWarm timber tones, beautiful contemporary finishes and loads of natural light. \r\nAnd the location? It doesn't get much better!\r\nPositioned directly opposite Mairangi Bay Park and just a short 500m flat walk from the village and beach, you'll have everything you need right at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nFeatures You'll Love:\r\n* 4 generous bedrooms - plenty of space for family, guests or working from home\r\n* 3 bathrooms for busy households \r\n* Master Bedroom retreat - enjoy the privacy and convenience of your own ensuite and bath \r\n* 2 Family-sized bathrooms - beautifully appointed\r\n* Additional sitting area - the perfect second living space, kids' retreat, study or quiet zone\r\n* Contemporary kitchen - stylish, practical and designed to be the hub of the home\r\n* Brand new & move-in ready - enjoy all the benefits of a new build without the renovation list\r\n* Freehold section - approximately 169m2 of land with approximately 186.7m2 of floor area (more or less)\r\n* 10-Year Master Build Guarantee - added confidence for years to come\r\n\r\nLocation Highlights:\r\n* Beach & village lifestyle - stroll to Mairangi Bay Beach, cafes, shops and local amenities\r\n* Right opposite Mairangi Bay Park - an incredible asset for families, kids and outdoor living\r\n* Top school zones - Mairangi Bay School, Murrays Bay Intermediate, Rangitoto College & Westlake Girls High School\r\n* Active lifestyle - close to local tennis, golf, sailing, surf lifesaving and sporting facilities\r\n* Coastal living - enjoy sunrise morning walks, beach days and beautiful East Coast Bays surroundings\r\n* Easy access - convenient connections to Albany, Constellation Drive and the motorway\r\n\r\nThis is brand-new living without compromising on space, style or location.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for your next family home, a low-maintenance lock-up-and-leave or a smart addition to your property portfolio, this home deserves your attention. \r\nCome and see why Mairangi Bay is one of the North Shore's most sought-after places to call home!\r\n\r\nSay yes to the address! \r\nWe welcome agents from all other agencies from day one. \r\n\r\nPlease note: Photography shown is of Lot 4, the design and layout varies between homes. Please contact Claire for further information.\r\n\r\n4/1 Matipo Road, Mairangi Bay\r\nrwmairangibay.co.nz/MRG36017",
